OL,3,GNEWSAIn pictures: King Charles arrives
OL,4,Aat Balmoral
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III has been welcomed by a
OL,7,Fguard of honour provided by the Royal
OL,8,FRegiment of Scotland as he arrived at
OL,9,FBalmoral for his summer break.
OL,11,FThe King, who is Colonel in Chief of
OL,12,Fthe regiment, inspected soldiers from
OL,13,FBalaklava Company, 5th Battalion, who
OL,14,Ftook up royal guard duties in July and
OL,15,Fwill remain in Balmoral until October.
OL,17,FKing Charles also met Corporal Cruachan
OL,18,FIV ` the Shetland pony who is the
OL,19,Fregiment's mascot and was on parade
OL,20,Fwith his handler Cpl Rory Stewart.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
