OL,3,GNEWSAIn pictures: King Charles arrives
OL,4,Aat Balmoral
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor Tommy Blair, who is in his second
OL,7,Fyear in command of Balaklava Company,
OL,8,Fsaid: "Welcoming His Majesty the King
OL,9,Fto Balmoral is a huge privilege for
OL,10,FBalaklava Company.
